333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (For this project, we explored different web scraping tools, including Scrapy, Selenium, and BeautifulSoup, to collect stock data and news articles from Yahoo Finance. Scrapy and Selenium were difficult to use due to dynamic content loading and anti-bot protections, making them less efficient for our needs. BeautifulSoup worked best as it allowed us to extract data quickly and with fewer technical issues.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
