335 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our findings show that news sentiment plays a significant role in market trends. Positive sentiment often aligns with strong investor confidence, while negative sentiment reflects potential risks or uncertainties. Since many investors rely on news when deciding whether to buy, hold, or sell stocks, sentiment analysis provides an objective way to assess market conditions. This approach can be valuable for predicting stock movements and understanding how public perception impacts financial markets.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
